Package: buzzard-agent-web
Version: 1.202608.0+buzzard1
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openresearchtools <229047507+openresearchtools@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: buzzard-agent (= 0.84.1+buzzard1), libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, ca-certificates
Recommends: dbus-user-session
Homepage: https://github.com/openresearchtools/buzzard-agent
Description: independent web UI and session daemon for Buzzard Agent
 Buzzard Agent Web provides a local web UI, HTTP API, and persistent-session
 daemon for a Pi-compatible coding agent. It defaults to Buzzard Agent when
 installed, owns a pinned Node.js runtime, and exposes stable control commands.
